&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG0ADxOiPO0UafrjtMwaa3WHt6LKnSfA8gtqN821vBW5w&oe=6A8EF043"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "AAA Trailer Cover 2560x1440.png", "id": "912786578210970", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619681_912786581544303_1789462832436055605_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Pw3DK-Dz8dwQ7kNvwHIqE-j&_nc_oc=AdqvIkbOUvHfaR3_aSGXHDnywZKM1-P-kcATVes7Nc5iuRIF_nJpYmVYw1wdLNBqI2k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHHp7w1h_F0TZD7xsCmJaPNO1S-N2XbVIb4gvXqO85jyA&oe=6A8ED1A5"}, "display_name": "Asteroids And Aliens", "keywords": ["Sword", "Gun", "Alien", "Robots", "PvE"], "long_description": "Welcome to MASS, the Mega Asteroid Suppression Service, Agent. Your job is to protect this space station with your lightning sabers against Asteroids and Aliens. Are you ready?\n\nTest Your Skills!\n\n- 10 missions with increasing difficulty, can you complete them all?\n\n- 1V1 mode against an elite alien drone.\n\n- Use the local leader-board to compete with friends and family.\n\nEarn Goudas And Unlock Items!\n\n- Unlock cosmetic upgrades for your sabers.\n\n- Discover new alien landscapes and add them to your collection.\n\n- Uncover a secret weapon befitting an elite MASS agent.\n\nImmersive VR Environments!\n\n- 3d sound to help you pinpoint the location of enemies.\n\n- Unique alien landscapes with custom music.\n\nand More!\n\n- Play in endless mode, adjust the angle and speed to fit your skill level.\n\n- Fight your way to the top of the global leader-board.\n\n- Animated credits scene featuring a dance battle between the Attackians and MASS.\n\n- Access the Alien Dex to examine the Attackians up close.\n\nGood Luck, Agent.", "short_description": "Test your skills in this immersive VR space opera by Star 1 Studio. Utilize lightning sabers to strike down hordes of bionic extraterrestrials. Fight your way to the heart of the planet to defeat Attackian Leader RahKah. 